    return its corresponding weekday name as a lowercase string.
    Here 0 -> 'monday', 1 -> 'tuesday', and so on.
    If ``inverse``, then perform the inverse operation."""
    s = ['monday', 'tuesday', 'wednesday', 'thursday', 'friday', 'saturday', 'sunday']
